WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.320
We didn’t order any parcel.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.640
Bloody unwanted parcel!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.360
Do we look like delivery guys to you?

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.840
We’ll tie you up in a bundle so tight,

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.840
you won’t be able to breathe.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.720
Who are you guys?

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:18.520
Where are you from?

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.080
How would you recognise us?

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.280
You are the only legend in the entire universe 

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.320
who hasn’t watched Mirzapur.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.200
I have heard about Singapore.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.000
Where is Mirzapur located?

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.800
It’s located on your a**.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.000
Mirzapur: The Movie is trending on Prime Video,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.440
And you still haven't seen it!

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.840
From Titwala to Toronto,

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.480
from Balia to Bali,

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.840
we run the show everywhere.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.240
Total domination!

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.960
We ruled all of India for 3 seasons.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.920
Then we unleashed hell in theaters too.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.800
Look at me.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.360
I killed a hundred. He killed seventy.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.240
We even beat up each other for your entertainment,

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.240
and you still haven't seen it?

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.080
Sorry.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.160
No need to be sorry.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.760
Quickly take the chicken position.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.000
Chicken?

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.200
Yes, chicken.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.640
Bhaiyyaji, I still have Diwali prep left to do.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:12.040
Otherwise Mom will beat me with a rolling pin.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:15.240
We'll handle the Diwali arrangements.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:17.480
You arrange to watch Mirzapur.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.280
Say, “Aaa”

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.920
Aaaa…

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:20.960
Resume.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.840
So the thing is…

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.840
Mirzapur has come home.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.680
Now you watch it at home too.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.840
Otherwise… the Mirzapur boys will come to your house.

